Mangyaring umupo sandali.

00:32:01.566 --> 00:32:04.027
Diba sabi mo wala ka ng time?

00:32:04.110 --> 00:32:05.820
-Pakiusap, sandali lang.
-Kabutihan.

00:32:05.904 --> 00:32:07.447
sus. Seryoso.

00:32:07.531 --> 00:32:09.199
Talagang nagmamaneho ka ng isang hard bargain.

00:32:10.867 --> 00:32:12.869
Sige. Pagkatapos ay gagawin ko…

00:32:16.915 --> 00:32:18.458
Tanungin ko ang aking direktor.

00:32:18.542 --> 00:32:20.210
Ano ang itatanong?

00:32:20.919 --> 00:32:22.671
I bet wala kang masasabi dito.

00:32:22.754 --> 00:32:23.755
Ito ay wala.

00:32:23.838 --> 00:32:25.131
Matalas ang pandinig niya.

00:32:31.763 --> 00:32:33.598
Itong nakakakuryenteng tensyon.

00:32:34.266 --> 00:32:36.059
Ang instinct ng sugarol na ito.

00:32:36.560 --> 00:32:38.520
Sampung-milyong-isang-buwan Nak-su!

