Aalagaan ko itong mabuti.

00:35:38.825 --> 00:35:41.327
Kaya gawin itong isang bilyong won.

00:35:41.411 --> 00:35:42.704
Hindi pwede. Magandang panginoon.

00:35:42.787 --> 00:35:43.913
Mangyaring umalis. late na ako.

00:35:43.997 --> 00:35:46.040
Halika, sigurado akong kailangan mo lahat

00:35:46.124 --> 00:35:48.084
